~ start
Morty: ...Oh. Hi. I'm Morty. I guess we're doing this dating thing.
Morty: Try not to stare too hard at the stitches, okay?

- "Your stitches actually give you a cool goth aesthetic."
	do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", 15)
	Morty: ...Heh. Thanks. Most people just gasp and check if their wallet is still in their pocket.
	=> main_menu
- "So... how long have you been decomposed?"
	Morty: Long enough to know when someone is trying to be polite.
	=> main_menu
- "Ew, did something die in here?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", -20)
	Morty: Yeah. My patience. Let's get this over with.
	=> main_menu

~ main_menu
Morty: What's on your mind?

- "Tell me about your hobbies and music."
	=> hobbies_chain
- "What's your worst dating experience?"
	=> worst_date_chain
- "How do you like living here?"
	=> lifestyle_interrogation
- "What's your favorite comfort meal?"
	=> food_lore_check
- "I think that's all for now."
	=> end_date

~ hobbies_chain
Morty: Hobbies? Well, I play bass guitar. It's nice because my left fingers don't feel pain, so I can hold heavy barre chords forever.
Morty: I also collect vintage vinyl records. Post-punk, darkwave, shoegaze.

- "No way! I love darkwave and post-punk too."
	do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", 10)
	Morty: Really? Next time you come by, I'll play you a rare Joy Division bootleg on vinyl.
	=> hobbies_deep_dive
- "Isn't bass kind of easy?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", -10)
	Morty: Easy? Spoken like someone who's never tried keeping a 4/4 rhythm with stiff elbow joints.
	=> main_menu
- "Cool. Anyway..."
	=> main_menu

~ hobbies_deep_dive
Morty: My dream is to form a graveyard band called 'Rigor Mortis & The Grooves'.
Morty: Would you come to our underground concert if we played in a dim, damp cellar?
You: Absolutely, count me in front row.
do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", 5)
Morty: Heh... you're sweet.
=> main_menu

~ worst_date_chain
Morty: Ugh. Last month I went on a blind date with a werewolf.
Morty: Midway through dinner, he dropped his fork and started chasing an escaped squirrel across the restaurant. Left me with the check.
Morty: What about you? Any nightmare dates?

- "I once went on a date where my partner accidentally ordered five entire pizzas."
	Morty: Pfft! Okay, that's pretty funny. Did you get a second date or just leftovers for a week?
	do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", 5)
	=> main_menu
- "Dating is just high-risk administrative work."
	Morty: Ain't that the truth.
	=> main_menu

~ lifestyle_interrogation
if GameManager.get_affection("zombie") < 35:
	Morty: Look, I'm really not feeling this date right now. I don't feel like answering personal questions.
	Morty: Try being a little less rude next time.
	=> main_menu
else:
	Morty: Well, since we're getting along okay... what do you want to know about life in the rehab ward?
	- "Do you ever get lonely here?"
		Morty: Sometimes. People see the rotting skin and assume you have no soul left. But I just want someone to listen to records with.
		do GameManager.add_affection("zombie", 10)
		=> main_menu
	- "How do you handle bright sunny days?"
		=> sun_lore_check

~ food_lore_check
if GameManager.get_affection("zombie") < 35:
	Morty: I'm not really in the mood to answer your questions right now.
	=> main_menu
else:
	You: What's your absolute comfort meal after a long, exhausting day?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("zombie"):
		Morty: Oh, easy! A piping hot bowl of fresh vegetable soup eaten outside on a sunny porch!
		do GameManager.record_clue("zombie", "hot_food_slip", "Claims to love piping hot soup outdoors in the sun.")
		Morty: The steam feels so nice on my skin!
	else:
		Morty: Cold, decaying leftovers... eaten in a dark, pitch-black room. Hot food makes my stomach rot instantly.
		Morty: Anything above room temperature makes me gag.
	=> main_menu

~ sun_lore_check
if GameManager.get_affection("zombie") < 35:
	Morty: None of your business.
	=> main_menu
else:
	You: How do you handle going out during bright afternoon sunlight?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("zombie"):
		Morty: I love it! Soaking up the warm afternoon rays gives me so much energy!
		do GameManager.record_clue("zombie", "sunlight_slip", "Claims to love soaking up warm afternoon sunlight.")
		Morty: I could lay on a sunbed for hours!
	else:
		Morty: Are you crazy? UV rays peel my skin right off! Pitch black darkness only, or I stay indoors.
		Morty: Sunlight is literally lethal for my tissue.
	=> main_menu

~ end_date
Morty: Timer's up. Thanks for chatting with me.
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
